<title>TAIWAN: TENNIS-TAIWAN LEAD INDONESIA 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-TAIWAN LEAD INDONESIA 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan lead Indonesia 2-0 in</p>
<p>their Davis Cup Asia/Oceania zone group one play-off tie after</p>
<p>winning both singles matches on Friday.</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>Tsai Chia-yen beat Bonit Wiryawan 7-5 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Chen Chih-jung beat Andrian Raturandang 6-4 6-0 6-3</p>
</text>
